ng><br\/>Dirt, bacteria, and tear fluid accumulate every day.<br\/><strong>Without cleaning, your dog risks inflammation, infection, and in the worst <\/strong>case, permanent damage to the eyes.<br\/>It hurts to think about, but the fact is:<br\/><strong>Paper towels, cotton pads, or baby wipes<\/strong> are not the solution.<br\/>They can actually <strong>spread bacteria and make the problem even worse.<\/strong><br\/>You shouldn't have to worry every time you look at your dog.<br\/><strong>That's why we created Eyewipes<\/strong> – a simple, gentle routine that both cleans and protects.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}},"atc_button_EcfpAg":{"type":"atc_button","settings":{"button_label":"ADD TO CART","atc_product":"eyewipes-prevention-that-keeps-eyes-clear","atc_skip_cart":false}},"text_with_icon_UM6Bmj":{"type":"text_with_icon","settings":{"mobile_text_size":14,"desktop_text_size":16,"alignment":"left","mobile_alignment":"left","text_color":"#121212","text_1":"100-Day Money-Back Guarantee","text_2":"","text_3":"","icon_scale":120,"icon_color":"#47b5e9","icon_1":"new_releases","filled_icon_1":true,"icon_2":"check_circle","filled_icon_2":false,"icon_3":"check_circle","filled_icon_3":false,"width":"100%","direction":"vertical","column_gap":1,"enable_bg":false,"bg_color":"#f3f3f3","corner_radius":40,"padding":2,"border_size":0,"border_color":"#b7b7b7"}}},"block_order":["heading_JmVVwF","text_3Qterz","atc_button_EcfpAg","text_with_icon_UM6Bmj"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/eye-wipes_1.webp","video_autoplay":true,"video_loop":true,"height":"adapt","color_scheme":"custom","section_color_scheme":"custom","full_desktop_width":false,"content_layout":"no-overlap","desktop_media_width":50,"layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_full_media_width":false,"mobile_direction":"normal","mobile_image_quanlity":"2","m